commit e3ee473b
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:41:21 -0600
subject: fix(gitlab-pat): add 10s AbortSignal.timeout + 504 timeout response (GAP-P2-20)

- Added signal: AbortSignal.timeout(10000) to the fetch verifying a GitLab PAT
  against /api/v4/user. Self-hosted GitLab behind firewalls can no longer hang
  the connection indefinitely.
- Catch block now detects AbortError/TimeoutError and returns HTTP 504 with a
  clear timeout message instead of a generic 500.
- Added tests/unit/gitlab-pat-timeout.test.js (8 tests): body validation,
  missing token, failed verification, happy path, AbortSignal presence,
  timeout->504, default base URL, custom base URL.
- Anti-false-positive check confirmed: breaking an assertion fails the suite.

